# each and the .git history had grown ~1.2 GB of them (PASS4 §7). A frame
# without its sidecar is not evidence; a sidecar without its frame is the
# record. The .git HISTORY rewrite to reclaim the space is OWED, Ryan's go
# (recorded in the register), and is NOT this change -- this only stops NEW
# frames entering, and untracks the current ones.
_verify/**/*.png
_verify/**/*.exr

